# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvanceIgnoresUnstampedSeen
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance ignores the shared unstamped watermark, so it passes a 10.2.0 silo's record
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ pend => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
\* MUTATION: no shared-watermark bound.
    /\ pend => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- END
